  "referenceNumber": "IRN0181",
  "remarks": "\nNasser ABU SHARIF is an involved person within the meaning of the Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 on the basis of the following ground: ABU SHARIF is or has been involved in hostile activity by an armed group backed by the Government of Iran, namely threatening, planning or conducting activity which is intended to cause the destabilisation of Israel. .",
